{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人何沛珈（Roxanne）在無綫戀綜《女神配對計劃2》中頻惹是非，在昨晚（2日）播出一集內，她玩水上滑梯時嚇到爆喊，卻被網民鬧假，Roxanne前度阮浩棕今日（2日）現身無綫活動時，力撐前度為人，他稱雖然未有收看節目，但有看過網上部分片段</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T13:01:19.559266+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:11:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:58:18.693533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:58:18.693533+00:00","content_hash":"9ab05c111f65729219b30d4bd81c203a3b31e91e0da4f7f1c18a516042e0523f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}